 r←Test_TableEdit_006(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;n;⎕TRAP;table;rowTitles
⍝ Delete all rows, then insert one without specifying "rowPrototype" and "dataTypes".
 r←∆Inactive
 :Return

 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

⍝⍝⍝ Preconditions
 table←⍉⊃('Obama' 'Bush' 'Clinton' 'Reagan' 'Kennedy' 'Carter')(1 0 1 0 1 1)
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Table.CreateParms
 parms.posn←35 25
 parms.size←400 600
 parms.colTitles←'Name' 'Democrat'
 parms.addToCaption←'Testing Table.Run'
 parms.confirmQuit←0
 parms.testMode←1

 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Table.Create table #.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults parms

 n.Grid.SelItems←(0 0)(⍴n.Grid.Values)
 #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Table.ExecPrivateFns'RowDelete'n  ⍝ Delete all rows
 →GoToTidyUp 0 2≢⍴n.Grid.Values

 #.APLGUI.APLGUI.Table.ExecPrivateFns'RowInsert'(n 0 1)  ⍝ Insert one row
 →GoToTidyUp 1 2≢⍴n.Grid.Values

 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
